-042-wangyi-ws2626092","chapter_id":"c-beishi-042-wangyi","paragraph_id":"c-beishi-042-wangyi:p001","quote":"深","mention_id":"c-beishi-042-wangyi:p001:m0008"},{"work_id":"w-nanqishu","book_id":"b-nanqishu-049","source_id":"s-nanqishu-049-ws2261984-wanghuan","chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-049-wanghuan","paragraph_id":"c-nanqishu-049-wanghuan:p002","quote":"琛","mention_id":"c-nanqishu-049-wanghuan:p002:m0018"},{"work_id":"w-epitaph-wanglingyuan","book_id":"b-epitaph-wanglingyuan-excerpts","chapter_id":"c-epitaph-wanglingyuan-excerpts","source_id":"s-epitaph-wanglingyuan-daitof00792","paragraph_id":"c-epitaph-wanglingyuan-excerpts:p001","quote":"琛","mention_id":"c-epitaph-wanglingyuan-excerpts:p001:m0001"}],"identity_note":"南齊司徒從事中郎，王奐之子、王翊之父。《北史》父名異文作深，該段末的子琛屬王翊子代。","review":"ai_provisional","family_path":{"connection":"father","generation_distance":1,"parent_person_id":"q7m_r8k_2vn_AA","status":"contextual_provisional","human_reviewed":false,"source_assertion_id":"a-wangyi-epitaph-chen-huan-pedigree","evidence":[{"work_id":"w-epitaph-wangyi","book_id":"b-epitaph-wangyi-excerpts","source_id":"s-epitaph-wangyi-excerpts-rubbing-reproduction","chapter_id":"c-epitaph-wangyi-excerpts","paragraph_id":"c-epitaph-wangyi-excerpts:p001","quote":"祖諱奐，齊故尚書左僕射、使持節、鎮北將軍、雍州刺史。夫人陳郡殷氏，父道矜，太中大夫。父諱琛，齊故司徒從事中郎。夫人彭城劉氏，嘉興縣主，父義恭，宋太宰江夏王。公諱翊，字仕翔，徐州琅耶郡臨沂縣都鄉南仁里人也。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-epitaph-wangyi-excerpts:p001:m0044","object_person_mention_id":"c-epitaph-wangyi-excerpts:p001:m0002","source_term":"祖諱奐"}],"interpretation_note":"據墓誌同列父琛與祖奐的父系世次判讀；《南齊書》王奐傳也以琛為長子融之弟。"}},{"id":"q7m_r8k_2vn_AAAA","label":"王翊","status":"active","historicity":"historical_tradition","aliases":[{"surface":"王使君","mention_ids":["c-epitaph-wangyi-excerpts:p000:m0009"]},{"surface":"翊","mention_ids":["c-epitaph-wangyi-excerpts:p001:m0080","c-weishu-weishou-063-wangyi:p001:m0000","c-beishi-042-wangyi:p001:m0000","c-epitaph-wanglingyuan-excerpts:p001:m0032"]},{"surface":"仕翔","mention_ids":["c-epitaph-wangyi-excerpts:p001: