anzhan-excerpts","chapter_id":"c-epitaph-yuanzhan-excerpts","source_id":"s-epitaph-yuanzhan-daitof00794","paragraph_id":"c-epitaph-yuanzhan-excerpts:p003","quote":"春秋卅有五，以武定二年歲在甲子五月十四日丁酉薨於鄴。","role":"burial_year_context"},{"work_id":"w-epitaph-yuanzhan","book_id":"b-epitaph-yuanzhan-excerpts","chapter_id":"c-epitaph-yuanzhan-excerpts","source_id":"s-epitaph-yuanzhan-daitof00794","paragraph_id":"c-epitaph-yuanzhan-excerpts:p004","quote":"王如故，謚曰文獻，禮也。粵以其年八月庚申葬於武城之北原。","role":"matching_burial_attestation"},{"work_id":"w-epitaph-yuanzhan","book_id":"b-epitaph-yuanzhan-excerpts","chapter_id":"c-epitaph-yuanzhan-excerpts","source_id":"s-epitaph-yuanzhan-daitof00794","paragraph_id":"c-epitaph-yuanzhan-excerpts:p005","quote":"芒阜臨北，魚山望東，安厝不異，託葬攸同。","role":"shared_burial_wording"}],"interpretation_note":"王妃誌直載夫號、王令媛姓名，並明言合葬。元湛誌題為同一廣陽文獻王，名湛、字士深，誌載同日同地入葬，銘辭稱託葬攸同，未直書妃名。婚期與子女未見明載。","reviewer":"Codex（AI代理）","human_reviewed":false,"model":null}],"family_tree_policy":{"default":"editorial_preferred","original_assertions_preserved":true,"unreviewed_conflicts_may_remain":true,"runtime_ai_required":false},"family_paths":[{"connection":"father","generation_distance":1,"parent_person_id":"q7m_r8k_2vn_AAAA","status":"contextual_provisional","human_reviewed":false,"source_assertion_id":"a-wanglingyuan-epitaph-father","evidence":[{"work_id":"w-epitaph-wanglingyuan","book_id":"b-epitaph-wanglingyuan-excerpts","chapter_id":"c-epitaph-wanglingyuan-excerpts","source_id":"s-epitaph-wanglingyuan-daitof00792","paragraph_id":"c-epitaph-wanglingyuan-excerpts:p001","quote":"祖琛，齊司徒從事中郎。祖母彭城劉氏，父義恭，宋太宰江夏文獻王。父翊，魏侍中司空孝獻公。母河南元氏，父澄，假黃鉞太傅任城文宣王。妃姓王，諱令媛，琅邪臨沂人，齊尚書僕射奐之曾孫也。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-epitaph-wanglingyuan-excerpts:p001:m0068","object_person_mention_id":"c-epitaph-wanglingyuan-excerpts:p001:m0032","source_term":"父翊，魏侍中司空孝獻公"}],"interpretation_note":"誌首明載父名、官及諡。","person_id":"q7m_r8k_2vn_AAAAA"}],"name_components":[{"id":"name-wanglingyuan-epitaph","person_id":"q7m_r8k_2vn_AAAAA","surname":"王",